      "mergeID": "5ad99c0ca127f31dadabedf3",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Allow us to make a type of public instance in which the person who makes the room has the ability to kick people. That way if people \nare playing werewolf or courtroom they can still have public players join and trolls can be dealt with right away.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Let room creator kick people",
